VRT_L("tle-c-anglais-complex-sentences",{"titre":"Complex sentences: coordination and subordination","duree":35,"famille":"Economic life and occupations","agir":"Join ideas into clear compound and complex sentences with the right conjunctions","accroche":"“I applied for the job. I had no experience. They called me.” Three short sentences, three missing links. Which conjunctions make one strong sentence?","intro":"Nchang, an Upper Sixth student in Buea, writes a motivation letter for a holiday job. His short, unlinked sentences will help you master coordination and subordination.","objectifs":["distinguish simple, compound and complex sentences","use coordinating conjunctions (FANBOYS) correctly","use subordinating conjunctions of time, reason, contrast, purpose and condition","punctuate compound and complex sentences"],"enquete":{"titre":"Nchang's motivation letter","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 220' role='img' aria-label='A student types a letter at a cybercafé in Buea; Mount Cameroon is visible through the window; a job advert is pinned on the wall' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='220' fill='#fff'/><defs><linearGradient id='cxC' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0.00' stop-color='#DDEBDA'/><stop offset='1.00' stop-color='#F4F1EA'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='640' height='220' fill='url(#cxC)'/><rect x='380' y='16' width='240' height='120' fill='#BFD9EA' stroke='#6B4423' stroke-width='5'/><path d='M390 130L470 50L520 90L560 60L610 130Z' fill='#5C564C'/><path d='M455 66L470 50L485 66Z' fill='#F4F8FC'/><rect y='186' width='640' height='34' fill='#8F8A80'/><rect x='120' y='120' width='200' height='10' fill='#5C3A1E'/><rect x='180' y='84' width='70' height='36' fill='#2E3445'/><rect x='184' y='88' width='62' height='26' fill='#9FC5E8'/><g transform='translate(110 96)'><ellipse cx='0' cy='84' rx='18' ry='4' fill='#001136' opacity='.18'/><rect x='-9' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><rect x='1' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><ellipse cx='-6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><ellipse cx='6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M-13 46L-16 18C-16 13 -12 11 -6 10H6C12 11 16 13 16 18L13 46Z' fill='#F4F1EA'/><path d='M-15 16L-20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M15 16L20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='-20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><circle cx='20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><rect x='-3.5' y='5' width='7' height='7' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='0' cy='-2' rx='9' ry='10.5' fill='#4A2E1A'/><path d='M-9 -4C-10 -14 -4 -13.5 0 -13.5S10 -14 9 -4C7 -9 -7 -9 -9 -4Z' fill='#1B1410'/><ellipse cx='-9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/></g><rect x='30' y='30' width='60' height='60' fill='#fff' stroke='#C62828'/><text x='60' y='54' text-anchor='middle' font-size='12' font-weight='700' fill='#C62828'>JOB</text><text x='60' y='72' text-anchor='middle' font-size='10' font-weight='700' fill='#C62828'>OFFER</text><rect x='150' y='20' width='220' height='30' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#F7C948'/><text x='260' y='40' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11.5' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>and? but? because?</text><text x='634' y='215' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>","legende":"In Buea, Nchang writes a motivation letter for a holiday job at a tea estate.","contexte":"<p>Nchang writes: “I am a hard worker. I have no experience. I want this job. I want to pay my school fees. I will learn fast. You give me a chance.” His sister reads it and says: “It sounds like a robot! And ‘because I want to pay my fees, so I want this job’ is not English either.”</p>","documents":[{"t":"Three kinds of sentences","html":"<p>Simple: one clause. Compound: two main clauses joined by a coordinating conjunction. Complex: a main clause and at least one subordinate clause introduced by a subordinating conjunction.</p>"}],"question":"How can Nchang join his ideas into clear, correct compound and complex sentences?","tache":"Learn coordinating and subordinating conjunctions, then rewrite Nchang's letter with linked sentences.","hypotheses":["Short simple sentences are always better in a letter.","We can use two conjunctions for the same link: “because…, so…”.","Coordination joins equal clauses (and, but, so…); subordination joins a dependent clause to a main clause (because, although, if, so that…); one conjunction per link."]},"parties":[{"t":"Simple, compound and complex sentences","html":"<div class='def'><b>Clause</b>A group of words with a subject and a verb. A main (independent) clause can stand alone; a subordinate (dependent) clause cannot.</div><ul><li><strong>Simple sentence</strong>: one main clause — <em>I am a hard worker.</em></li><li><strong>Compound sentence</strong>: two main clauses joined by a coordinating conjunction — <em>I am a hard worker, <strong>but</strong> I have no experience.</em></li><li><strong>Complex sentence</strong>: a main clause + a subordinate clause — <em>I want this job <strong>because</strong> I need to pay my school fees.</em></li></ul><div class='def'><b>Coordinating conjunctions (FANBOYS)</b><strong>F</strong>or, <strong>A</strong>nd, <strong>N</strong>or, <strong>B</strong>ut, <strong>O</strong>r, <strong>Y</strong>et, <strong>S</strong>o — they join clauses of equal importance.</div><p class='formule'>compound = main clause + , + FANBOYS + main clause</p><div class='ex'><b>Compound sentences</b><em>I have no experience, <strong>yet</strong> I learn fast.</em> / <em>I need money, <strong>so</strong> I am looking for a job.</em></div><div class='attention'><b>French speakers, watch out!</b>Do not use two conjunctions for one link: not « Because I need money, so I want this job » (French « parce que…, donc… »).</div>","planches":[{"type":"2D","titre":"Three kinds of sentences","legende":"A simple sentence has one clause; a compound sentence joins equals; a complex sentence hangs a subordinate clause on a main clause.","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 210' role='img' aria-label='Three columns: simple, compound and complex sentences' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='210' fill='#fff'/><defs></defs><rect width='640' height='210' fill='#FBF8F2'/><text x='320' y='28' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>Simple, compound, complex</text><rect x='15' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#7B6B4A' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='15' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='34' rx='11' fill='#7B6B4A'/><text x='112.66666666666667' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Simple</text><text x='25' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>one main clause</text><text x='25' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>I work hard.</text><rect x='222.33333333333334' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#1E499B' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='222.33333333333334' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='34' rx='11' fill='#1E499B'/><text x='320' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Compound</text><text x='232.33333333333334' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>main + FANBOYS + main</text><text x='232.33333333333334' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>I work hard,</text><text x='232.33333333333334' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>but I am new.</text><rect x='429.6666666666667' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#2E7D32' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='429.6666666666667' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='34' rx='11' fill='#2E7D32'/><text x='527.3333333333334' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Complex</text><text x='439.6666666666667' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>main + subordinate</text><text x='439.6666666666667' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>I work hard</text><text x='439.6666666666667' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>because I need money.</text><text x='634' y='205' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>"}],"fil":{"html":"<p>Nchang's letter has only <strong>simple</strong> sentences: the ideas are there, but the links are missing. “I am a hard worker. I have no experience.” becomes “I am a hard worker, <strong>but</strong> I have no experience.”</p>","verdicts":[[0,"rejetee","Only simple sentences sound mechanical: linking ideas shows the logic of the letter."]]},"retenir":"Simple (1 clause), compound (FANBOYS), complex (main + subordinate)."},{"t":"Subordinating conjunctions","verrou":true},{"t":"Punctuation and style","verrou":true},{"t":"Vers le Baccalauréat","verrou":true}],"revision":[],"exo":"","quiz":[],"c":"Tle C","rang":18,"m":"anglais","payant":true,"apc":{"module":"ECONOMIC LIFE AND OCCUPATIONS","famille":"Vie sociale et culturelle","agir":"Communicate about economic life and occupations","situation":"Nchang writes: “I am a hard worker. I have no experience. I want this job. I want to pay my school fees. I will learn fast. You give me a chance.” His sister reads it and says: “It sounds like a robot! And ‘because I want to pay my fees, so I want this job’ is not English either.”","tache":"Learn coordinating and subordinating conjunctions, then rewrite Nchang's letter with linked sentences."},"verrou":true,"nq":10,"labo":true});
VRT_L("tle-c-anglais-comparing",{"titre":"Other forms of comparing: equality, degree, double comparatives","duree":35,"famille":"Economic life and occupations","agir":"Compare prices, products and people precisely with equality, degree and double comparatives","accroche":"“This phone is as cheap as that one.” “This one is twice as expensive.” “The more you save, the richer you get.” Comparing is more than “bigger than”!","intro":"Akwa and his cousin compare two motorbikes at a shop in Bafoussam before buying one for their family business. Their sentences will help you master advanced comparisons.","objectifs":["express equality and inequality (as… as, not as/so… as)","express degree (twice as… as, much / far / a bit + comparative)","use double comparatives (the more…, the more…; bigger and bigger)","avoid common mistakes (more better, as… than)"],"enquete":{"titre":"Choosing a motorbike in Bafoussam","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 220' role='img' aria-label='Two motorbikes in front of a shop with price tags; two young men compare them, one holds a calculator' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='220' fill='#fff'/><defs><linearGradient id='cpC' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0.00' stop-color='#F3E7D3'/><stop offset='1.00' stop-color='#F4F1EA'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='640' height='220' fill='url(#cpC)'/><rect y='186' width='640' height='34' fill='#8F8A80'/><rect x='300' y='20' width='320' height='60' fill='#1E499B'/><text x='460' y='56' text-anchor='middle' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>MOTO SHOP — BAFOUSSAM</text><circle cx='310' cy='170' r='16' fill='#1F2328'/><circle cx='370' cy='170' r='16' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M310 168L340 140L370 168' stroke='#C62828' stroke-width='8' fill='none'/><rect x='304' y='100' width='72' height='20' fill='#fff' stroke='#9AA3AF'/><text x='340' y='115' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>650 000 F</text><circle cx='470' cy='170' r='16' fill='#1F2328'/><circle cx='530' cy='170' r='16' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M470 168L500 140L530 168' stroke='#2E7D32' stroke-width='8' fill='none'/><rect x='464' y='100' width='72' height='20' fill='#fff' stroke='#9AA3AF'/><text x='500' y='115' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>325 000 F</text><g transform='translate(100 96)'><ellipse cx='0' cy='84' rx='18' ry='4' fill='#001136' opacity='.18'/><rect x='-9' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#2E3445'/><rect x='1' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#2E3445'/><ellipse cx='-6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><ellipse cx='6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M-13 46L-16 18C-16 13 -12 11 -6 10H6C12 11 16 13 16 18L13 46Z' fill='#F7C948'/><path d='M-15 16L-20 40' stroke='#F7C948' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M15 16L20 40' stroke='#F7C948' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='-20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#5A3A1E'/><circle cx='20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#5A3A1E'/><rect x='-3.5' y='5' width='7' height='7' fill='#5A3A1E'/><ellipse cx='0' cy='-2' rx='9' ry='10.5' fill='#5A3A1E'/><path d='M-9 -4C-10 -14 -4 -13.5 0 -13.5S10 -14 9 -4C7 -9 -7 -9 -9 -4Z' fill='#1B1410'/><ellipse cx='-9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#5A3A1E'/><ellipse cx='9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#5A3A1E'/></g><g transform='translate(180 96)'><ellipse cx='0' cy='84' rx='18' ry='4' fill='#001136' opacity='.18'/><rect x='-9' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#2E3445'/><rect x='1' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#2E3445'/><ellipse cx='-6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><ellipse cx='6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M-13 46L-16 18C-16 13 -12 11 -6 10H6C12 11 16 13 16 18L13 46Z' fill='#7B3F99'/><path d='M-15 16L-20 40' stroke='#7B3F99' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M15 16L20 40' stroke='#7B3F99' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='-20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><circle cx='20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><rect x='-3.5' y='5' width='7' height='7' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='0' cy='-2' rx='9' ry='10.5' fill='#4A2E1A'/><path d='M-9 -4C-10 -14 -4 -13.5 0 -13.5S10 -14 9 -4C7 -9 -7 -9 -9 -4Z' fill='#1B1410'/><ellipse cx='-9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/></g><rect x='20' y='30' width='230' height='30' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#F7C948'/><text x='135' y='50' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11.5' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>It is more cheaper!</text><text x='634' y='215' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>","legende":"In Bafoussam, Akwa and his cousin compare two motorbikes for their delivery business.","contexte":"<p>The red motorbike costs 650,000 F, the green one 325,000 F. Akwa says: “The green one is more cheaper and it is as strong than the red one.” His cousin answers: “The red one is two times more expensive, but the more it is expensive, the more it lasts.” The salesman smiles: “Your English needs comparing lessons!”</p>","documents":[{"t":"The facts","html":"<p>Red: 650,000 F, 150 cc, 5-year guarantee. Green: 325,000 F, 125 cc, 2-year guarantee. Both carry two people.</p>"}],"question":"How can Akwa and his cousin compare the two motorbikes correctly and precisely?","tache":"Learn equality, degree and double comparatives, then write five correct sentences comparing the motorbikes.","hypotheses":["“More cheaper” is correct because it insists on the difference.","We say “as strong than” for equality.","Equality uses as… as; degree uses twice as… as or much + comparative; double comparatives use the + comparative, the + comparative; never more + -er."]},"parties":[{"t":"Equality and inequality","html":"<div class='def'><b>Comparison of equality</b><em>as + adjective / adverb + as</em>: two things are the same in some way. <em>The green bike carries as many people as the red one.</em></div><ul><li><strong>Equality</strong>: <em>as strong as, as fast as, as much money as, as many passengers as</em>.</li><li><strong>Inequality</strong>: <em>not as / not so + adjective + as</em> — <em>The green bike is <strong>not as powerful as</strong> the red one.</em></li><li><strong>Reminder</strong>: short adjectives + <em>-er than</em> (cheaper than); long adjectives <em>more… than</em> (more expensive than); irregular: good → better, bad → worse, far → further.</li></ul><p class='formule'>as + adjective + as ; not as + adjective + as</p><div class='ex'><b>Example</b><em>The green motorbike is <strong>cheaper than</strong> the red one, but it is <strong>not as powerful as</strong> the red one.</em></div><div class='attention'><b>French speakers, watch out!</b>Never « more cheaper » (double comparative) or « as… than »: <em>cheaper</em>, <em>as strong as</em>.</div>","planches":[{"type":"2D","titre":"Comparing the two motorbikes","legende":"The red motorbike costs twice as much, has a bigger engine and a longer guarantee; both carry two people.","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 140' role='img' aria-label='Bar chart: red motorbike 650,000 F, green motorbike 325,000 F' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='140' fill='#fff'/><defs></defs><rect width='640' height='140' fill='#FBF8F2'/><text x='320' y='28' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>Price of the motorbikes (in thousands of FCFA)</text><text x='200' y='70' text-anchor='end' font-size='12.5' font-weight='600' fill='#001136'>red motorbike</text><rect x='210' y='52' width='330' height='24' rx='6' fill='#C62828'/><text x='548' y='69' text-anchor='start' font-size='12' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>650 000 F</text><text x='200' y='106' text-anchor='end' font-size='12.5' font-weight='600' fill='#001136'>green motorbike</text><rect x='210' y='88' width='165' height='24' rx='6' fill='#2E7D32'/><text x='383' y='105' text-anchor='start' font-size='12' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>325 000 F</text><text x='634' y='135' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>"}],"fil":{"html":"<p>“More cheaper” and “as strong than” are two classic mistakes. Correct: “The green one is <strong>cheaper</strong>, but it is <strong>not as strong as</strong> the red one.” And with the facts: “It carries <strong>as many people as</strong> the red one.”</p>","verdicts":[[0,"rejetee","Never more + -er: cheaper, not more cheaper."]]},"retenir":"as… as (equality), not as… as (inequality); -er than / more… than; no more + -er."},{"t":"Degree: how much more or less?","verrou":true},{"t":"Double comparatives and preferences","verrou":true,"illus":{"legende":"Three advanced structures. Multiples, parallel increase and progressive change make comparisons precise and natural.","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 210' role='img' aria-label='Four columns: multiples, double comparatives, progressive change, preference' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='210' fill='#fff'/><defs></defs><rect width='640' height='210' fill='#FBF8F2'/><text x='320' y='28' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>Advanced comparing</text><rect x='15' y='44' width='143.5' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#C62828' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='15' y='44' width='143.5' height='34' rx='11' fill='#C62828'/><text x='86.75' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Multiples</text><text x='25' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>twice as… as</text><text x='25' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>half as much as</text><text x='25' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='800' fill='#C62828'>→ precise</text><rect x='170.5' y='44' width='143.5' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#1E499B' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='170.5' y='44' width='143.5' height='34' rx='11' fill='#1E499B'/><text x='242.25' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>The…, the…</text><text x='180.5' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>the more…,</text><text x='180.5' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>the more…</text><text x='180.5' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='800' fill='#1E499B'>→ parallel change</text><rect x='326' y='44' width='143.5' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#2E7D32' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='326' y='44' width='143.5' height='34' rx='11' fill='#2E7D32'/><text x='397.75' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>-er and -er</text><text x='336' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>more and more</text><text x='336' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>better and better</text><text x='336' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='800' fill='#2E7D32'>→ progressive</text><rect x='481.5' y='44' width='143.5' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#7B3F99' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='481.5' y='44' width='143.5' height='34' rx='11' fill='#7B3F99'/><text x='553.25' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Preference</text><text x='491.5' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>prefer A to B</text><text x='491.5' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>would rather… than</text><text x='491.5' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='800' fill='#7B3F99'>→ choice</text><text x='634' y='205' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>"}},{"t":"Vers le Baccalauréat","verrou":true}],"revision":[],"exo":"","quiz":[],"c":"Tle C","rang":23,"m":"anglais","payant":true,"apc":{"module":"ECONOMIC LIFE AND OCCUPATIONS","famille":"Vie sociale et culturelle","agir":"Communicate about economic life and occupations","situation":"The red motorbike costs 650,000 F, the green one 325,000 F. Akwa says: “The green one is more cheaper and it is as strong than the red one.” His cousin answers: “The red one is two times more expensive, but the more it is expensive, the more it lasts.” The salesman smiles: “Your English needs comparing lessons!”","tache":"Learn equality, degree and double comparatives, then write five correct sentences comparing the motorbikes."},"verrou":true,"nq":10,"labo":true});
VRT_L("tle-c-anglais-conditionals",{"titre":"Conditionals 1, 2 and 3: real, imaginary and impossible past","duree":40,"famille":"Environment, well-being and health","agir":"Express real possibilities, imaginary situations and regrets about the past with the three conditionals","accroche":"“If I had revised, I would have passed.” Regret about the past needs the third conditional. Can you build it without mistakes?","intro":"After the mock Baccalauréat, Asong and her friends in Kumba talk about their results, their dreams and their regrets. Their sentences will help you master the three conditionals.","objectifs":["review the first and second conditionals","form the third conditional (if + past perfect, would have + past participle)","choose the conditional according to time and reality","express regrets with “I wish” and “if only”"],"enquete":{"titre":"After the mock exam in Kumba","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 220' role='img' aria-label='Three students sit under a tree in a schoolyard holding result sheets: one smiles, one dreams, one looks sad' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='220' fill='#fff'/><defs><linearGradient id='c3C' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0.00' stop-color='#DDEBDA'/><stop offset='1.00' stop-color='#F4F1EA'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='640' height='220' fill='url(#c3C)'/><rect y='186' width='640' height='34' fill='#C9A06E'/><rect x='300' y='60' width='14' height='126' fill='#5C3A1E'/><ellipse cx='307' cy='50' rx='110' ry='44' fill='#2E7D32'/><g transform='translate(160 98)'><ellipse cx='0' cy='84' rx='18' ry='4' fill='#001136' opacity='.18'/><rect x='-9' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><rect x='1' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><ellipse cx='-6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><ellipse cx='6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M-13 46L-16 18C-16 13 -12 11 -6 10H6C12 11 16 13 16 18L13 46Z' fill='#F4F1EA'/><path d='M-15 16L-20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M15 16L20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='-20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><circle cx='20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><rect x='-3.5' y='5' width='7' height='7' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='0' cy='-2' rx='9' ry='10.5' fill='#4A2E1A'/><path d='M-9 -4C-10 -14 -4 -13.5 0 -13.5S10 -14 9 -4C7 -9 -7 -9 -9 -4Z' fill='#1B1410'/><ellipse cx='-9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/></g><g transform='translate(300 100)'><ellipse cx='0' cy='84' rx='18' ry='4' fill='#001136' opacity='.18'/><rect x='-9' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><rect x='1' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><ellipse cx='-6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><ellipse cx='6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M-13 46L-16 18C-16 13 -12 11 -6 10H6C12 11 16 13 16 18L13 46Z' fill='#F4F1EA'/><path d='M-15 16L-20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M15 16L20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='-20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#5A3A1E'/><circle cx='20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#5A3A1E'/><rect x='-3.5' y='5' width='7' height='7' fill='#5A3A1E'/><ellipse cx='0' cy='-2' rx='9' ry='10.5' fill='#5A3A1E'/><path d='M-9 -4C-10 -14 -4 -13.5 0 -13.5S10 -14 9 -4C7 -9 -7 -9 -9 -4Z' fill='#1B1410'/><ellipse cx='-9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#5A3A1E'/><ellipse cx='9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#5A3A1E'/></g><g transform='translate(450 98)'><ellipse cx='0' cy='84' rx='18' ry='4' fill='#001136' opacity='.18'/><rect x='-9' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><rect x='1' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#1E499B'/><ellipse cx='-6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><ellipse cx='6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M-13 46L-16 18C-16 13 -12 11 -6 10H6C12 11 16 13 16 18L13 46Z' fill='#F4F1EA'/><path d='M-15 16L-20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M15 16L20 40' stroke='#F4F1EA' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='-20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#6B4423'/><circle cx='20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#6B4423'/><rect x='-3.5' y='5' width='7' height='7' fill='#6B4423'/><ellipse cx='0' cy='-2' rx='9' ry='10.5' fill='#6B4423'/><path d='M-9 -4C-10 -14 -4 -13.5 0 -13.5S10 -14 9 -4C7 -9 -7 -9 -9 -4Z' fill='#1B1410'/><ellipse cx='-9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#6B4423'/><ellipse cx='9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#6B4423'/></g><rect x='20' y='140' width='200' height='30' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#F7C948'/><text x='120' y='160' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11.5' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>If I revise, …</text><rect x='220' y='140' width='200' height='30' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#9FC5E8'/><text x='320' y='160' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11.5' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>If I were…</text><rect x='420' y='140' width='210' height='30' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#F4B6B6'/><text x='525' y='160' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11.5' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>If I had revised…</text><text x='634' y='215' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>","legende":"In Kumba, three Upper Sixth students talk about their mock exam results.","contexte":"<p>Asong passed: “If I will revise every day, I will pass the real exam.” Bate dreams: “If I would be the Minister of Education, I would give free books.” Eyong failed: “If I revised, I would pass.” Their teacher says: “Three times wrong! Asong's future is real, Bate is imagining, and Eyong is talking about the past.”</p>","documents":[{"t":"Three moments","html":"<p>Real future (possible) → first conditional. Imaginary present or future → second conditional. Past that cannot be changed → third conditional.</p>"}],"question":"How do we choose and form the right conditional for the future, the imaginary present and the past?","tache":"Review conditionals 1 and 2, learn the third conditional, then correct the three students' sentences.","hypotheses":["We can use will or would after if when we speak about the future.","The second conditional is also used for regrets about the past.","1st: if + present, will; 2nd: if + past, would; 3rd: if + past perfect, would have + past participle; never will / would in the if-clause."]},"parties":[{"t":"Review: first and second conditionals","html":"<div class='def'><b>Conditional sentence</b>A sentence with two clauses: an <em>if</em>-clause (the condition) and a main clause (the result). The tenses depend on the time and on how real the situation is.</div><ul><li><strong>First conditional</strong> (real possibility): <em>If + present simple, will + verb</em> — <em>If I revise every day, I will pass.</em></li><li><strong>Second conditional</strong> (imaginary present / future): <em>If + past simple, would + verb</em> — <em>If I were the Minister, I would give free books.</em></li><li><strong>Were</strong> for all persons with <em>be</em> in the second conditional.</li></ul><p class='formule'>1st: if + present → will ; 2nd: if + past → would</p><div class='ex'><b>Examples</b><em>If it rains, the match will be cancelled.</em> (possible) / <em>If I had a car, I would drive you home.</em> (I have no car)</div><div class='attention'><b>French speakers, watch out!</b>No <em>will</em> and no <em>would</em> in the if-clause: « If I will revise », « If I would be » are wrong.</div>","planches":[{"type":"2D","titre":"First or second?","legende":"The difference is not the time but the reality: possible or imagined.","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 210' role='img' aria-label='Two columns: first and second conditionals' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='210' fill='#fff'/><defs></defs><rect width='640' height='210' fill='#FBF8F2'/><text x='320' y='28' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>Two conditionals for now and the future</text><rect x='15' y='44' width='299' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#2E7D32' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='15' y='44' width='299' height='34' rx='11' fill='#2E7D32'/><text x='164.5' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>First</text><text x='25' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>possible</text><text x='25' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>if + present</text><text x='25' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>will + verb</text><text x='25' y='169' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='800' fill='#2E7D32'>→ If I revise, I will pass</text><rect x='326' y='44' width='299' height='152' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#7B3F99' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='326' y='44' width='299' height='34' rx='11' fill='#7B3F99'/><text x='475.5' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Second</text><text x='336' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>imaginary</text><text x='336' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>if + past</text><text x='336' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>would + verb</text><text x='336' y='169' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='800' fill='#7B3F99'>→ If I were…, I would…</text><text x='634' y='205' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>"}],"fil":{"html":"<p>Asong's future is possible: “If I <strong>revise</strong> every day, I <strong>will pass</strong>.” Bate is imagining: “If I <strong>were</strong> the Minister of Education, I <strong>would give</strong> free books.” No will or would after if.</p>","verdicts":[[0,"rejetee","Never will or would in the if-clause."]]},"retenir":"1st: if + present, will; 2nd: if + past, would; were for all persons."},{"t":"The third conditional: the impossible past","verrou":true},{"t":"Choosing the conditional; I wish and if only","verrou":true},{"t":"Vers le Baccalauréat","verrou":true}],"revision":[],"exo":"","quiz":[],"c":"Tle C","rang":34,"m":"anglais","payant":true,"apc":{"module":"ENVIRONMENT WELL-BEING AND HEALTH","famille":"Vie sociale et culturelle","agir":"Communicate about environment well-being and health","situation":"Asong passed: “If I will revise every day, I will pass the real exam.” Bate dreams: “If I would be the Minister of Education, I would give free books.” Eyong failed: “If I revised, I would pass.” Their teacher says: “Three times wrong! Asong's future is real, Bate is imagining, and Eyong is talking about the past.”","tache":"Review conditionals 1 and 2, learn the third conditional, then correct the three students' sentences."},"verrou":true,"nq":10,"labo":true});
VRT_L("tle-c-anglais-composition",{"titre":"Writing a composition: plan, paragraphs and linking words","duree":40,"famille":"Environment, well-being and health","agir":"Plan and write a clear, well-organised composition on a social or environmental topic","accroche":"“Write a composition of about 250 words on garbage collection in your town.” Many students start writing at once… and lose marks. What do good writers do first?","intro":"Tabe, an Upper Sixth student in Limbe, writes a composition about rubbish in her neighbourhood. Her first draft and her corrected version will show you how to plan and write a composition.","objectifs":["analyse the topic and brainstorm ideas","build a plan: introduction, body paragraphs, conclusion","write paragraphs with a topic sentence, supporting details and examples","use linking words and check the final draft"],"enquete":{"titre":"Tabe's composition on rubbish","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 220' role='img' aria-label='A street in Limbe with an overflowing dustbin and plastic bottles; a girl writes in a notebook on a bench' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='220' fill='#fff'/><defs><linearGradient id='wrC' x1='0' y1='0' x2='0' y2='1'><stop offset='0.00' stop-color='#BFD9EA'/><stop offset='1.00' stop-color='#F4F1EA'/></linearGradient></defs><rect width='640' height='220' fill='url(#wrC)'/><rect y='176' width='640' height='44' fill='#8F8A80'/><rect x='400' y='110' width='70' height='66' fill='#2E7D32'/><ellipse cx='435' cy='106' rx='50' ry='16' fill='#7B6B4A'/><rect x='370' y='168' width='10' height='18' rx='3' fill='#9FC5E8' transform='rotate(0 375 176)'/><rect x='400' y='162' width='10' height='18' rx='3' fill='#F4F8FC' transform='rotate(30 405 176)'/><rect x='430' y='168' width='10' height='18' rx='3' fill='#C62828' transform='rotate(60 435 176)'/><rect x='460' y='162' width='10' height='18' rx='3' fill='#9FC5E8' transform='rotate(90 465 176)'/><rect x='490' y='168' width='10' height='18' rx='3' fill='#F4F8FC' transform='rotate(120 495 176)'/><rect x='520' y='162' width='10' height='18' rx='3' fill='#C62828' transform='rotate(150 525 176)'/><rect x='80' y='150' width='160' height='10' fill='#5C3A1E'/><g transform='translate(150 76)'><ellipse cx='0' cy='84' rx='18' ry='4' fill='#001136' opacity='.18'/><rect x='-9' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#5C2D6E'/><rect x='1' y='44' width='8' height='36' rx='3' fill='#5C2D6E'/><ellipse cx='-6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><ellipse cx='6' cy='81' rx='7' ry='3.5' fill='#1F2328'/><path d='M-13 46L-16 18C-16 13 -12 11 -6 10H6C12 11 16 13 16 18L13 46Z' fill='#7B3F99'/><path d='M-15 16L-20 40' stroke='#7B3F99' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><path d='M15 16L20 40' stroke='#7B3F99' stroke-width='7' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='-20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><circle cx='20' cy='42' r='3.6' fill='#4A2E1A'/><rect x='-3.5' y='5' width='7' height='7' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='0' cy='-2' rx='9' ry='10.5' fill='#4A2E1A'/><path d='M-9 -4C-10 -14 -4 -13.5 0 -13.5S10 -14 9 -4C7 -9 -7 -9 -9 -4Z' fill='#1B1410'/><ellipse cx='-9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/><ellipse cx='9' cy='-1' rx='1.8' ry='3' fill='#4A2E1A'/></g><rect x='164' y='104' width='26' height='20' fill='#fff' stroke='#9AA3AF'/><rect x='20' y='20' width='240' height='30' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#F7C948'/><text x='140' y='40' text-anchor='middle' font-size='11.5' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>Where do I start?</text><text x='634' y='215' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>","legende":"In Limbe, Tabe writes a composition about rubbish in her neighbourhood.","contexte":"<p>Tabe's first draft is one long block of 400 words: she talks about plastic bottles, then about her uncle's car, then about rubbish again, and finishes with “That is all.” Her teacher writes: “No plan, no paragraphs, off the topic, too long. 7/20.”</p>","documents":[{"t":"The topic","html":"<p>“Rubbish is a serious problem in many Cameroonian towns. Write a composition of about 250 words on the causes and consequences of poor garbage collection in your town and suggest solutions.”</p>"}],"question":"How can Tabe plan and write a clear composition that answers the topic?","tache":"Analyse the topic, build a plan, write structured paragraphs with linking words, then check the draft.","hypotheses":["A good composition is a long text with as many ideas as possible.","We do not need a plan: ideas come while writing.","A good composition answers the topic exactly, with an introduction, body paragraphs (one idea each) and a conclusion, linked by connectors, in the required length."]},"parties":[{"t":"Analyse the topic and brainstorm","html":"<div class='def'><b>Composition</b>A piece of continuous writing (often 200 to 300 words in exams) that develops ideas on a given topic in organised paragraphs.</div><ul><li><strong>Read the topic twice</strong> and underline the key words: <em>causes</em>, <em>consequences</em>, <em>solutions</em>, <em>your town</em>, <em>about 250 words</em>.</li><li><strong>Identify the type</strong>: argumentative (for / against), descriptive, narrative, expository (causes, consequences, solutions).</li><li><strong>Brainstorm</strong>: write all your ideas quickly in three lists (causes / consequences / solutions), then keep the best two or three in each.</li></ul><p class='formule'>key words + type of composition + brainstorming → plan</p><div class='ex'><b>Tabe's brainstorming</b>Causes: few dustbins, irregular trucks, bad habits. Consequences: blocked gutters and floods, malaria and cholera, ugly streets. Solutions: more bins, regular collection, recycling, awareness campaigns.</div><div class='attention'><b>Watch out!</b>Everything off the topic (her uncle's car) costs marks: each idea must answer the question.</div>","planches":[{"type":"2D","titre":"Brainstorming in three lists","legende":"Sorting ideas before writing makes the plan obvious: one list becomes one body paragraph.","svg":"<svg viewBox='0 0 640 220' role='img' aria-label='Three columns: causes, consequences and solutions of poor garbage collection' font-family='Inter,Arial,sans-serif'><rect width='640' height='220' fill='#fff'/><defs></defs><rect width='640' height='220' fill='#FBF8F2'/><text x='320' y='28' text-anchor='middle' font-size='15' font-weight='700' fill='#001136'>Rubbish in Limbe</text><rect x='15' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='162' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#C62828' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='15' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='34' rx='11' fill='#C62828'/><text x='112.66666666666667' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Causes</text><text x='25' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>few dustbins</text><text x='25' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>irregular trucks</text><text x='25' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>bad habits</text><text x='25' y='169' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>plastic bags</text><rect x='222.33333333333334' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='162' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#C2540A' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='222.33333333333334' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='34' rx='11' fill='#C2540A'/><text x='320' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Consequences</text><text x='232.33333333333334' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>blocked gutters</text><text x='232.33333333333334' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>floods</text><text x='232.33333333333334' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>malaria, cholera</text><text x='232.33333333333334' y='169' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>ugly streets</text><rect x='429.6666666666667' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='162' rx='12' fill='#fff' stroke='#2E7D32' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='429.6666666666667' y='44' width='195.33333333333334' height='34' rx='11' fill='#2E7D32'/><text x='527.3333333333334' y='66' text-anchor='middle' font-size='13.5' font-weight='700' fill='#fff'>Solutions</text><text x='439.6666666666667' y='100' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>more bins</text><text x='439.6666666666667' y='123' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>regular collection</text><text x='439.6666666666667' y='146' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>recycling</text><text x='439.6666666666667' y='169' text-anchor='start' font-size='11.5' font-weight='550' fill='#001136'>awareness</text><text x='634' y='215' font-size='8' text-anchor='end' fill='#8A93A6'>Planche VÉRITAS</text></svg>"}],"fil":{"html":"<p>Tabe never underlined the key words: she forgot <strong>solutions</strong> and wandered off the topic. With three lists, she now has exactly what the question asks: causes, consequences, solutions.</p>","verdicts":[[0,"rejetee","More words and more ideas do not make a good composition: relevance and organisation do."]]},"retenir":"Underline key words; identify the type; brainstorm in lists; stay on topic."},{"t":"Build the plan and write paragraphs","verrou":true},{"t":"Linking words and the final check","verrou":true},{"t":"Vers le Baccalauréat","verrou":true}],"revision":[],"exo":"","quiz":[],"c":"Tle C","rang":38,"m":"anglais","payant":true,"apc":{"module":"ENVIRONMENT WELL-BEING AND HEALTH (CONTINUED)","famille":"Vie sociale et culturelle","agir":"Communicate about environment well-being and health (continued)","situation":"Tabe's first draft is one long block of 400 words: she talks about plastic bottles, then about her uncle's car, then about rubbish again, and finishes with “That is all.” Her teacher writes: “No plan, no paragraphs, off the topic, too long. 7/20.”","tache":"Analyse the topic, build a plan, write structured paragraphs with linking words, then check the draft."},"verrou":true,"nq":10,"labo":true});
